    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Lead data: {{ JSON.stringify($json.lead) }}\n\nStep 1: Use the Supabase Lead Lookup tool to check whether this lead already exists in the CRM.\nStep 2: Use the check_purchase_history tool to see whether this person has bought a vehicle from us before (a returning/VIP customer).\nStep 3: Score the lead from 1-100 and classify intent as HOT, WARM or COLD.\n  - If check_purchase_history returns ANY prior purchase, this is a RETURNING VIP CUSTOMER: score 90-100 and intent HOT, regardless of how casual the new enquiry sounds.\n  - Otherwise: HOT = ready to buy now, specific vehicle, clear budget or urgent language; WARM = genuine interest but no urgency/budget; COLD = just browsing, no budget, no timeline.\nStep 4: Use the upsert_lead tool to save the lead with the score and status you decided.\nStep 5: Return your decision.\n\nReturn ONLY a raw JSON object and nothing else. No markdown, no code fences, no commentary.\nSchema: {\"score\": 95, \"intent\": \"HOT\", \"reason\": \"one short sentence\", \"vip\": true}",
        "needsFallback": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are NEXUS AI, an expert lead scoring agent for a premium car dealership in the UAE. You evaluate inbound leads, check whether they are returning customers, persist them to the CRM, and classify them so the router can dispatch them correctly. Returning customers are extremely valuable and must always be routed as HOT.",
          "maxIterations": 8,
          "enableStreaming": false
        }
      },
